# One checkout, one set of line endings.
#
# The demo writes LF and the committed golden file is LF, but the Git for Windows
# default (core.autocrlf=true) presented demo_output.txt as CRLF in the working
# tree, so a raw `diff` failed even though the output was correct. Pinning
# eol=lf here makes every platform match the index and CI.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Screenshots and icons must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
